# No electron_mirror override — electron-builder uses its default:
#   https://github.com/electron/electron/releases/download/
# electron-builder's app-builder binary constructs the URL as:
#   ${ELECTRON_MIRROR}v${version}/${filename}   <- correct, with v-prefix
# BUT when electron_mirror is set via .npmrc (npm_config_electron_mirror),
# app-builder uses it WITHOUT adding the v-prefix, producing a 404 on GitHub.
# Removing this setting avoids the broken URL and relies on the correct default.
